  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1145\">\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"900\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"899\">KRAS Mutation Detected</strong>:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"1145\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"975\">\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"975\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Indicates presence of an activating mutation in the <strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"974\">KRAS oncogene</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1051\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Common in <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1004\">colorectal</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1022\">lung (NSCLC)</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1050\">pancreatic cancers</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1145\">\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1145\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Associated with resistance to <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1113\">EGFR-targeted therapies</strong> (e.g., cetuximab, panitumumab).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1303\">\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1182\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1181\">KRAS Not Mutated (Wild-Type)</strong>:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1303\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1226\">\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1226\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No detectable mutation in tested exons.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1303\">\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1303\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Patient may be eligible for anti-EGFR therapy (if clinically indicated).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
